SUMMARY:Scottish Comedy Legends: Jack Docherty
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A a man steeped in UK comedy. From having first performed at th
 e Edinburgh Fringe in 1980 he quickly graduated to writing for such comedy 
 series as Spitting Image\, Alas Smith and Jones and The Lenny Henry Show be
 fore writing in performing in four series of Absolutely and launching his o
 wn late night chat show. Ever since\, Jack has been a staple on screen with
  Scot Squad and more recently The Chief as well as performing his own live 
 shows. He is also co-founder of Absolutely Productions.\nMore info: https:/
 /comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/scottish-comedy-legends-jack-docherty/
